{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:UnitalGroebnerBasesChapter.LeadingTermData","@type":"LeanModule","name":"UnitalGroebnerBasesChapter.LeadingTermData","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Order.WellFounded","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Module.Basic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.LeadingTermData.leadingCoeff_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.LeadingTermData.leadingCoeff_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-term-data.lean#L40-L40","doc":"The leading coefficient is nonzero (it lies in `R* = R ∖ {0}`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.LeadingTermData.leadingCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.LeadingTermData.leadingCoeff","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-term-data.lean#L38-L38","doc":"The leading coefficient `LC(f)`: the coefficient of `LM(f)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.LeadingTermData.leadingMono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.LeadingTermData.leadingMono","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-term-data.lean#L36-L36","doc":"The leading monomial `LM(f)`: the largest basis element in the support. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.LeadingTermData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.LeadingTermData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-term-data.lean#L34-L34","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.LeadingTermData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.GrobnerShirshov.ContentBlock.LeadingTermData","kind":"structure","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/unital-groebner-bases/unital-groebner-bases-chapter/leading-term-data.lean#L26-L40","doc":"Leading-term data for a nonzero element `f ∈ A` written in the\nmonomial basis `B` with respect to a well-ordering `<`.\n\nGiven `f = c₁b₁ + c₂b₂ + ⋯ + cₙbₙ` with `b₁ > b₂ > ⋯ > bₙ`:\n- `LM(f) = b₁`  (leading monomial)\n- `LC(f) = c₁`  (leading coefficient)\n- `LT(f) = c₁ · b₁` (leading term) ","signatureChunk":0}]}